11) EventsController (globale)

/api/admin/events

GET / → eventi realm (filtri: type, user, client, dateFrom, dateTo, first, max)

GET /admin → admin events (audit operazioni admin)

DELETE / → pulizia eventi (opzionale, se vuoi esporla)

12) SystemController

/api/admin/system

GET /health → health del tuo backend + reachability Keycloak

GET /whoami → info admin loggato (claims/ruoli)

GET /config → config runtime (base url keycloak, realm default, feature flags)